{"id":"850797688ebf0c98","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-lem-closed-preservation.md","title":"Closed Preservation","display":"lem-closed-preservation — Closed Preservation","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-closed-preservation","aliases":["58-lem-closed-preservation"],"display":"lem-closed-preservation — Closed Preservation","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-kappa-closed-poset.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-regular.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-closed-preservation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-closed-preservation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-closed-preservation — Closed Preservation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f6ffd36213690e39\" href=\"?note=f6ffd36213690e39\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-kappa-closed-poset.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-kappa-closed-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d83de8696e4dad26\" href=\"?note=d83de8696e4dad26\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-regular.md\">../batch16/58-df-regular.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (正则无限基数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d83de8696e4dad26\" href=\"?note=d83de8696e4dad26\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-regular.md\">../batch16/58-df-regular.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P,\\leq_P)\">\\((P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\kappa\">\\(&lt;\\kappa\\)</span>-闭偏序, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f6ffd36213690e39\" href=\"?note=f6ffd36213690e39\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-kappa-closed-poset.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-kappa-closed-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KappaClosedPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{KappaClosedPoset}_S\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\kappa\">\\(&lt;\\kappa\\)</span>-闭谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Reg}\">\\(\\mathrm{Reg}\\)</span> (正则基数谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{(P,\\leq_P)}\">\\(\\Vdash_{(P,\\leq_P)}\\)</span> (迫使关系)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}closed\\text{-}preservation} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{KappaClosedPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\kappa)\n\\to\\Vdash_{(P,\\leq_P)}\\mathrm{Reg}(\\check\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}closed\\text{-}preservation} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{KappaClosedPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\kappa)\n\\to\\Vdash_{(P,\\leq_P)}\\mathrm{Reg}(\\check\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Here “<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-closed” means every descending sequence of length <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\kappa\">\\(&lt;\\kappa\\)</span> has a lower bound.</li>\n<li>Closure preserves the regularity of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>; preservation of a particular large-cardinal property needs additional arguments.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-kappa-closed-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"f6ffd36213690e39","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-kappa-closed-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-regular.md","status":"resolved","id":"d83de8696e4dad26","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-regular.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-regular.md","status":"resolved","id":"d83de8696e4dad26","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\kappa$ (正则无限基数, see [[../batch16/58-df-regular.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-kappa-closed-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"f6ffd36213690e39","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(P,\\leq_P)$ ($<\\kappa$-闭偏序, see [[../batch04/58-df-zfc-kappa-closed-poset.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"(P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"<\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KappaClosedPoset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"<\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Reg}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Vdash_{(P,\\leq_P)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}closed\\text{-}preservation} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{KappaClosedPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\kappa)\n\\to\\Vdash_{(P,\\leq_P)}\\mathrm{Reg}(\\check\\kappa)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"<\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1090,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3880","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-lem-closed-preservation.md|58-lem-closed-preservation]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["f6ffd36213690e39","d83de8696e4dad26"]}